# Pins panic-mode recovery. The parser must report several errors in one run
# rather than dying at the first, and it must resynchronise at item,
# member and statement boundaries — the good items between the broken ones
# are what prove it did.
#
# This case exists to freeze the *diagnostics*, so the exact messages and
# their line:col are the assertion.

